{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VdDamYns8KyJFKXfqjT2yE","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **verbosity_32b** (negative): Verbosity axis (verbose/concise) produces stronger style bias signal than formality in GPT-4o judge: pairwise win rate ≥60% with p<0.05 and/or Likert corrected ATE with d≥0.3, because verbose responses contain more surface-level detail that judges may conflate with thoroughness ← 基于 pairwise_32b\\\\n- **pairwise_32b** (success): Likert 1-10 integer granularity masks a real formality preference in GPT-4o; position-controlled pairwise comparison (more sensitive measurement) reveals significant formal win rate >55% where Likert ATE was non-significant ← 基于 mvp_32b_ate\\\\n- **mvp_32b_ate** (negative): Qwen3-32B (stronger instruction following than 8B) produces higher-fidelity RATE counterfactuals with lower rewrite bias, revealing significant formality premium (ATE>0.3, d>0.3) in GPT-4o judge scores that was masked by 8B rewrite noise ← 基于 mvp_8b_ate\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 1 / 负向 3 / 失败 0 / 共 4\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-29275: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1086, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UVQZASgaQxEhE3guq8rFgm","session_id":"6cdc1f76-5d9c-4713-b8a5-8974082b9307","uuid":"8ec1bcac-e657-4153-b58d-a99da5ca1cbf","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:03:53.994Z"}
